[一句话概括 | PART 4: In Short]

代码可以商用（MIT）；mine/ 与 public/images/ 的素材可以免费用、免费改、打包进资源包
发给玩家，但不能拿去赚钱。
The code is MIT — commercial use allowed. The assets in mine/ and public/images/
are free to use, to modify and to ship inside Minecraft resource packs, but may
not be used to make money.

本项目为个人非官方作品，与 Mojang Studios / Microsoft 无任何关联。
This is an unofficial personal project. NOT AN OFFICIAL MINECRAFT PRODUCT. NOT
APPROVED BY OR ASSOCIATED WITH MOJANG OR MICROSOFT.
